  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NSMB.World.WorldDialogueTrigger
  speaker: ERIK
  lines:
  - 'ERIK (luigi.tmp)|Night job: he reverse-engineers console games. PS4 binary,
    shaders translated to SPIR-V, his own Vulkan renderer. He fixed hair that emulators
    get wrong.'
  - DAVID (mario.tmp)|Frame 1377. The hair rendered. I told everyone. Repeatedly.
  - "ERIK (luigi.tmp)|The green pipes are doors \u2014 stand on top of the story
    and press E. One leads to HawaiiOS, the operating system he built for this website."
  once: 1
