  lines:
  - "ERIK (luigi.tmp)|He sculpts too \u2014 Blender, EEVEE, Yakuza and Final Fantasy
    things. Which is how we eventually get faces that aren't... these."
  - "DAVID (mario.tmp)|The pipe at the end runs the classic Versus game this World
    grew out of \u2014 by ipodtouch0218 and contributors, used with permission. Bring
    a friend, it's real multiplayer on my own server."
  once: 1
